  "notes": [
    "Four difficulty settings with distinct connected maze routes, lighting, flashlight endurance, sprint stamina, locker availability and hunter senses.",
    "Nightmare removes flashlight and sprint, leaves 12 of 84 lockers usable, and caps pursuit below walking speed. Easy adds 24 shortcuts, 150 seconds of light, longer sprint and all lockers.",
    "One real hunter with bounded aggression that rises with live circuits and elapsed time; LOS breaks and noise investigation remain active.",
    "Rare harmless corner apparitions reveal from real cover, vanish in under a second and respect cooldowns and reduced-scare settings. Occasional spatial screams echo through the halls.",
    "Corrected objective numbering: the heading is unnumbered and the three breakers are numbered 1, 2 and 3."
